Wardlock is licensed in parts.

AGPL-3.0-only (full text in each directory's LICENSE file):
  apps/server/    the server, wardlockd
  apps/web/       the dashboard, embedded in the server
  packages/ui/    the dashboard design system

MIT (full text in each directory's LICENSE file, and below):
  apps/cli/                the command-line client, wardlock
  packages/api-spec/       the OpenAPI contract
  packages/apiclient-go/   the generated Go API client
  packages/apiclient-ts/   the generated TypeScript API client

Every other file in this repository (documentation, scripts, deployment
examples, fixtures, tooling configuration) is also MIT, under the text below.
Source files carry an SPDX-License-Identifier header naming their licence;
scripts/check-boundaries.mjs enforces it.

The sites you deploy with Wardlock are your own content. Neither licence
applies to them. See "Licensing" in README.md for common questions.

Vendored agent skills under .agents/skills/ keep their upstream licences;
see skills-lock.json for their sources.

